WEBVTT

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:02.256
Let's get a pumper

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:04.456
'Cause we need a pumper

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:08.696
Gotta find it, catch it, ride it
like some kind of jumper

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.896
Get down to your underwear

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:13.136
'Cause this heat is hard to bear

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.376
The rain is gonna come

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:17.536
This rain is gonna come, so...

00:07:17.560 --> 00:07:19.416
Let's get a pumper

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:21.576
Wanna see it from above

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:25.856
You can get it, fill it, drive it
like a fireman would do it

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.016
Drop the water here and there,

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.096
On my t-shirt, on my hair